```comment
T1136.001 - Create Account: Local Account
Index names: sysmon, wineventlog. Run over a short window (e.g. Last 15 minutes) when saving as an alert.
```

```comment
SEARCH A (validated): Sysmon process creation, net.exe / net1.exe adding a user.
Known false positive observed in lab: the forwarder install ran
  net localgroup "Performance Monitor Users" "NT SERVICE\SplunkForwarder" /add
which matched because "Users" contains "user".
```
index=sysmon EventCode=1 (Image="*\\net.exe" OR Image="*\\net1.exe") CommandLine="*user*/add*"
| table _time host User ParentImage CommandLine


```comment
SEARCH A-TUNED (UNTESTED): excludes localgroup operations.
```
index=sysmon EventCode=1 (Image="*\\net.exe" OR Image="*\\net1.exe") CommandLine="*user*/add*" NOT CommandLine="*localgroup*"
| table _time host User ParentImage CommandLine


```comment
SEARCH B (validated): Windows Security 4720, a user account was created.
Names are two values of the multivalue Account_Name field (creator first, new account second).
```
index=wineventlog EventCode=4720
| eval creator=mvindex(Account_Name,0), new_account=mvindex(Account_Name,1)
| table _time host creator new_account


```comment
SEARCH B-TUNED (UNTESTED): ignore machine-account creators such as DESKTOP-KF26PU8$ (account made during OS setup).
```
index=wineventlog EventCode=4720
| eval creator=mvindex(Account_Name,0), new_account=mvindex(Account_Name,1)
| where NOT like(creator, "%$")
| table _time host creator new_account
